            "date": 1729825368339,
            "name": "Commit-0",
            "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"en\">\r\n<head>\r\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n    <meta name=\"author\" content=\"Ryan Pemberton\">\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\">\r\n\t<meta name=\"description\" content=\"I make podcasts.\">\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"I make podcasts.\">\r\n\t<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Ryan Pemberton\">\r\n\t<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"pemberton, sound design, podcast producer, audio editor, reaper, sydney, australia\">\r\n\r\n    <title>Ryan Pemberton</title>\r\n\r\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/p5@1.11.0/lib/p5.min.js\"></script>\r\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/p5.js/1.11.0/addons/p5.sound.min.js\"></script>\r\n\r\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"favico.ico\"> <!--Have to add this-->\r\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@200;300;400;500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\r\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n    <script src=\"sketch.js\"></script>\r\n    <script src=\"bells.js\"></script>\r\n    <nav class=\"navbar\">\r\n        <h1 class=\"title\">Ryan Pemberton</h1>\r\n        <div class=\"navbar-links\">\r\n            <ul>\r\n                <li><a href=\"#audio\">Audio</a></li>\r\n                <li><a href=\"#teaching\">Teaching</a></li>\r\n                <li><a href=\"#coding\">Coding</a></li>\r\n                <li><a href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </nav>\r\n    <!-- <header id=\"cover\"></header> -->\r\n    <div class=\"wrapper\">\r\n        <main>\r\n            <div id=\"dummy\">\r\n                <!-- <img src=\"img/head-square.jpg\" alt=\"binaural dummy head\"> -->\r\n            </div>\r\n            \r\n            <section id=\"audio\">\r\n                <h2>Audio</h2>\r\n                <p>I'm a podcast producer, sound engineer, and teacher.</p>\r\n                <p>I created <a href=\"https://umweltpodcast.com.au/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Umwelt</a>, a podcast about how different animals experience the world.</p>\r\n                <p>I've sound designed and mixed podcasts for \r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/profile/ryan-pemberton\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Guardian</a>, \r\n                    <a href=\"https://australianaudioguide.com/podcast/trace/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ABC</a>, and \r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.artsimone.com/podcast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">iHeart Australia</a>.\r\n                </p>\r\n                <p>Currently, I'm the senior audio engineer for iHeartPodcast Network Australia</p>\r\n                <p><a href=\"/podcasts.html\">Here's an incomplete list of my podcast credits.</a></p>\r\n            </section>\r\n        \r\n            <section id=\"teaching\">\r\n                <h2>Teaching</h2>\r\n                <p>I teach podcasting at the University of Sydney.</p>\r\n                <p>I also occasionally lecture for other educational institutions and community organisations.</p>\r\n                <p>I'm available for <a href=\"#contact\">one-on-one tutoring, as well as consultation</a> for individuals and businesses to develop and enhance their podcast production workflows.</p>\r\n            </section>\r\n        \r\n            <section id=\"coding\">\r\n                <h2>Coding</h2>\r\n                <p>I often write code to automate aspects of my podcast work (usually in Python or Lua).</p>\r\n                <p>I also do <a href=\"https://birdsunderthespacestation.com/\" target=\"_blank\">creative programming projects</a> in my spare time.</p>\r\n                <p>My colleague Alex Tighe and I developed a system for delivering real-time, localized weather updates\r\n                    <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/your-news-now-how-iheart-built-australias-most-advanced-coombes/\", target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">into a news podcast,</a>\r\n                    without using AI. \r\n                </p>\r\n            </section>\r\n            <section id=\"contact\">\r\n                <h2>Contact</h2>\r\n                <form action=\"https://api.web3forms.com/submit\" method=\"POST\">\r\n\r\n                    <!-- Replace with your Access Key -->\r\n                    <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"access_key\" value=\"7e59f5ff-daa8-41e5-8565-15e7df9a7974\">\r\n                \r\n                    <!-- Form Inputs. Each input must have a name=\"\" attribute -->\r\n                    <label for=\"name\">Name:</label>\r\n                    <input type=\"text\" name=\"name\" required>\r\n                    <label for=\"email\">Email:</label>\r\n                    <input type=\"email\" name=\"email\" required>\r\n                    <label for=\"message\">Message:</label>\r\n                    <textarea name=\"message\" required></textarea>\r\n                \r\n                    <!-- Honeypot Spam Protection -->\r\n                    <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"botcheck\" class=\"hidden\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n                \r\n                    <!-- Custom Confirmation / Success Page -->\r\n                    <!-- <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"redirect\" value=\"https://mywebsite.com/thanks.html\"> -->\r\n                \r\n                    <button type=\"submit\">Submit</button>\r\n                \r\n                </form>\r\n            </section>\r\n        </main>\r\n    </div>\r\n    <!-- <script src=\"script.js\"\"></script> -->\r\n</body>\r\n</html>"
        }
    ]
